# The Python pipeline builds the dataset at author time; the deployed app only
# needs the generated JSON, which is committed under src/data/. Excluding it
# keeps the upload small and stops Vercel seeing pyproject.toml/uv.lock at the
# root and wondering whether this is a Python project.
src/scripts/
pyproject.toml
uv.lock
.venv/
.ruff_cache/
__pycache__/

# Notes and reference material, not needed to build or serve.
CLAUDE.md
